        "paragraph_id": "00DF24A3",
        "text": "Momentum balance equation"
      },
      {
        "container_path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_master.docx",
        "member": "word/document.xml",
        "start_xml_ordinal": 88548,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 4348,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 1874,
        "paragraph_id": "0B8D31FF",
        "text": "Second, we will outline the derivation of the u-momentum balance. The control volume is given in Figure C.2. It is centered around the u-point. We now consider the rate of change of the momentum in the local u-direction as follows:"
      }
    ],
    "following_nonempty_paragraphs": [
      {
        "container_path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_master.docx",
        "member": "word/document.xml",
        "start_xml_ordinal": 88704,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 4352,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 1878,
        "paragraph_id": "160B2F13",
        "text": "Where V is the cell volume, u the velocity in local grid direction, Q the fluxes, the density, g acceleration of gravity, τbu the bed shear stress, τsu, wind shear stress and Fu wave force in u-direction. We consider that the outgoing fluxes carry the velocity inside the cell, u and that uin is determined at each inflow boundary by interpolation, reconstructing the component in the same direction as u."
      },
      {
        "container_path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_master.docx",
        "member": "word/document.xml",
        "start_xml_ordinal": 88873,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 4354,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 1880,
        "paragraph_id": "46199C4E",
        "text": "The volume balance for the same volume reads:"
      }
    ],
